# Issue #123: makes a wrong database password fail with a one-line diagnosis instead of a
# Flyway stack trace forty lines into a service's log. See
# dev.nkap.server.persistence.WrongDatabasePasswordFailureAnalyzer's own javadoc.
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
dev.nkap.server.persistence.WrongDatabasePasswordFailureAnalyzer
